1 0 0 1 50 718 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 702 Tm (ABSTRACT:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 686 Tm (Payment fraud detection systems must balance high true-positive detection) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 670 Tm (against catastrophic false-positive customer disruptions. Extreme class imbalance) Tj
