1 0 0 1 50 622 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 606 Tm (1. RESEARCH PROBLEM:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 590 Tm (Severe class imbalance <0.2% fraud and adversarial feature shift in credit transaction str) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 574 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 558 Tm (2. OBJECTIVE:) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 542 Tm (Construct an unsupervised dual-attention autoencoder that reconstructs normal transaction) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 526 Tm (manifolds and flags anomalous reconstruction errors in real-time <15ms.) Tj
1 0 0 1 50 510 Tm () Tj
1 0 0 1 50 494 Tm (3. DATASET:) Tj
